    "bottomLine": "The practical choice for a solid-color deck when you want to buy locally and keep the budget reasonable.",
    "pros": [
      "Available at every Home Depot",
      "Wide color range with in-store tinting",
      "Acrylic formula with soap-and-water cleanup",
      "Works on decks, fences and siding",
      "Moderate price per gallon"
    ],
    "cons": [
      "Owners report shorter life on sunny horizontal surfaces than on vertical ones",
      "Two coats needed for even color",
      "Can peel if applied over old penetrating stain"
