          The 6 Best Deck Paints, Matched to the Deck You Have
        </h1>
        <QuickAnswer products={PRODUCTS} />
        <p class="text-lg lg:text-xl text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mt-5 mb-0">
          Painting a deck is a one-way door. Done on sound, dry wood with the right coating, it buys years of color. Done on the wrong deck, it peels by next summer. Here is how to tell which deck you have and what to put on it.
        </p>
